  (text "NOTAS:\n1. Alimentar WS2812B com fonte 5V externa (2A min para 30 LEDs)\n2. Capacitor 1000uF proximo da fita LED\n3. Resistor 330R no pino DIN do WS2812B\n4. SN74HCT245 aceita 3.3V como HIGH (TTL compatible)\n5. DIR=HIGH (A->B), OE=LOW (saidas habilitadas)"
    (at 139.7 127 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "0db154b2-8809-430e-a67e-07096ea6a0ca")
  )

  (text "CONEXOES ESP32 (J1):\nPin 1 = GPIO13 (Data LED)\nPin 2 = 3.3V\nPin 3 = 5V\nPin 4 = GND"
    (at 60.96, 96.52 0)
